    "text": "7 days ago  Anna Marie (Stuart) Horton, 67, of Harrison, Arkansas passed away peacefully at her home on October 5, 2025. She was born on June 1, 1958, in Silver City, New Mexico. She leaves behind her husband Dennis and many other family members that loved her dearly. Condolences may be left at www.DiamondStateCremation.com. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
